<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<qti-assessment-item xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0"
  xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
  xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0 https://purl.imsglobal.org/spec/qti/v3p0/schema/xsd/imsqti_asiv3p0_v1p0.xsd"
  identifier="stats-08" title="Complete the ANOVA table" adaptive="false" time-dependent="false" xml:lang="en">
  <qti-response-declaration identifier="RESPONSE_MSB" cardinality="single" base-type="float">
    <qti-correct-response>
      <qti-value>30</qti-value>
    </qti-correct-response>
  </qti-response-declaration>
  <qti-response-declaration identifier="RESPONSE_MSW" cardinality="single" base-type="float">
    <qti-correct-response>
      <qti-value>10</qti-value>
    </qti-correct-response>
  </qti-response-declaration>
  <qti-response-declaration identifier="RESPONSE_F" cardinality="single" base-type="float">
    <qti-correct-response>
      <qti-value>3</qti-value>
    </qti-correct-response>
  </qti-response-declaration>
  <qti-response-declaration identifier="RESPONSE_DECISION" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-correct-response>
      <qti-value>KEEP</qti-value>
    </qti-correct-response>
  </qti-response-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="SCORE" cardinality="single" base-type="float">
    <qti-default-value>
      <qti-value>0</qti-value>
    </qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="MAXSCORE" cardinality="single" base-type="float">
    <qti-default-value>
      <qti-value>2</qti-value>
    </qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-stylesheet href="stats.css" type="text/css"/>
  <qti-item-body>
    <p>An educational scientist tests whether drawing <em>concept maps</em> helps students learn. Ninety students are split evenly over three conditions:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Pure</strong>: instruction on how to draw a concept map;</li>
      <li><strong>Support</strong>: the same instruction, with part of the map already drawn;</li>
      <li><strong>Control</strong>: no instruction.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>All students then take the same exam. A one-way ANOVA on the exam scores gives the output below, but some cells are missing.</p>
    <table class="stats-output">
      <caption>ANOVA · Exam score</caption>
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">Source</th><th scope="col">Sum of squares</th><th scope="col">df</th><th scope="col">Mean square</th><th scope="col">F</th><th scope="col">Sig.</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><th scope="row">Between groups</th><td>60</td><td>2</td><td><qti-text-entry-interaction class="qti-input-width-6" response-identifier="RESPONSE_MSB" expected-length="5" placeholder-text="?"/></td><td><qti-text-entry-interaction class="qti-input-width-6" response-identifier="RESPONSE_F" expected-length="5" placeholder-text="?"/></td><td>.055</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Within groups</th><td>870</td><td>87</td><td><qti-text-entry-interaction class="qti-input-width-6" response-identifier="RESPONSE_MSW" expected-length="5" placeholder-text="?"/></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Total</th><td>930</td><td>89</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>Fill in the two mean squares and the <em>F</em>-value. Use a decimal point where you need one.</p>
    <p class="stats-sentence">At a significance level of α = .05, the researcher
      <qti-inline-choice-interaction response-identifier="RESPONSE_DECISION" shuffle="false">
        <qti-inline-choice identifier="REJECT">rejects H₀: the conditions differ significantly</qti-inline-choice>
        <qti-inline-choice identifier="KEEP">does not reject H₀: there is no significant difference</qti-inline-choice>
        <qti-inline-choice identifier="POSTHOC">rejects H₀: Pure and Support score higher than Control</qti-inline-choice>
      </qti-inline-choice-interaction>.
    </p>
  </qti-item-body>
  <qti-response-processing>
    <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE">
      <qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value>
    </qti-set-outcome-value>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-equal-rounded rounding-mode="decimalPlaces" figures="2">
          <qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE_MSB"/>
          <qti-correct identifier="RESPONSE_MSB"/>
        </qti-equal-rounded>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE">
          <qti-sum>
            <qti-variable identifier="SCORE"/>
            <qti-base-value base-type="float">0.5</qti-base-value>
          </qti-sum>
        </qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-equal-rounded rounding-mode="decimalPlaces" figures="2">
          <qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE_MSW"/>
          <qti-correct identifier="RESPONSE_MSW"/>
        </qti-equal-rounded>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE">
          <qti-sum>
            <qti-variable identifier="SCORE"/>
            <qti-base-value base-type="float">0.5</qti-base-value>
          </qti-sum>
        </qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-equal-rounded rounding-mode="decimalPlaces" figures="2">
          <qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE_F"/>
          <qti-correct identifier="RESPONSE_F"/>
        </qti-equal-rounded>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE">
          <qti-sum>
            <qti-variable identifier="SCORE"/>
            <qti-base-value base-type="float">0.5</qti-base-value>
          </qti-sum>
        </qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-match>
          <qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE_DECISION"/>
          <qti-correct identifier="RESPONSE_DECISION"/>
        </qti-match>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE">
          <qti-sum>
            <qti-variable identifier="SCORE"/>
            <qti-base-value base-type="float">0.5</qti-base-value>
          </qti-sum>
        </qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
  </qti-response-processing>
</qti-assessment-item>
